{"title":"Best Selling Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003cp\u003eUnveil Your Ideal Artificial Christmas Tree\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStep into a world of holiday wonder with our premier collection of artificial Christmas trees, loved by customers nationwide. At Carol's Christmas Conifers, we bring you our most popular trees, each one crafted to help you create the perfect festive atmosphere. Whether you're seeking a timeless green tree, a snow-flocked masterpiece, or something unique, our best sellers cater to every style and space, from cozy nooks to grand living rooms.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Variety of Styles to Elevate Your Holiday Decor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur best-selling trees are available in a range of styles, from the classic green that echoes tradition to modern, flocked options that bring a touch of winter indoors. Whatever your vision, these trees are designed to enhance your holiday décor effortlessly, providing a stunning centerpiece that will be admired by all.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSimple Setup, Easy Storage\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDesigned with convenience in mind, our artificial trees are as easy to assemble as they are to take down. With user-friendly features, including hinged branches and sturdy stands, decorating is a joy rather than a chore. Plus, each tree comes with a storage solution that ensures it stays pristine, ready to bring joy year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake Your Holidays Memorable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBring the spirit of the season into your home with our best-selling artificial Christmas trees. Their lifelike branches, vibrant colors, and quality craftsmanship make them the perfect choice for creating lasting holiday memories. Join countless others in celebrating with Carol's Christmas Conifers and let our trees be a part of your cherished traditions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"6' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 350 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642895921216,"sku":"PF-T6-L","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fbb2edf4-c5c9-4ad1-b201-ca0c1c1c4b0e.jpg?v=1714675465"},{"product_id":"7-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"7' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":41965569769672,"sku":"PF-T7-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fa622227-8cc4-441c-b46e-a6f7c09044bd.jpg?v=1714675463"},{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 550 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896379968,"sku":"PF-T8-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_5024a958-646c-4413-8cbb-72107e8ba72d.jpg?v=1714675448"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642897461312,"sku":"QF-T7.5-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-5.jpg?v=1718158615"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 800 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642897657920,"sku":"QF-T7.5-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_27cc53c6-965e-42b2-aec7-3712ea7dcff9.jpg?v=1722012616"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-