ow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642902212672,"sku":"KFS-T9-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSlim_75ca9054-4438-4cb7-8f01-f0b3c6b36b67.jpg?v=1714673452"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-flock-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642904178752,"sku":"KF-T7.5-U","price":349.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree_36525e9c-27ba-46fb-b73f-75e48db45eb8.jpg?v=1718158692"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Yorkshire Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642909257792,"sku":"YF-T7.5-